<title>FRANCE: Lagardere confirms Thomson-CSF bid.</title>
<headline>Lagardere confirms Thomson-CSF bid.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Missiles-to-publishing conglomerate Lagardere Groupe confirmed on Friday it is a candidate in the privatisation of defence electronics firm Thomson-CSF.</p>
<p>&quot;Lagardere confirms it is a candidate,&quot; a company spookesman said.</p>
<p>The French government had set 1100 GMT, March 28 as the deadline for filing intentions to bid for Thomson-CSF.</p>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom officials were not immediately available for comment. Alcatel had said it would make a joint bid with privately-held Dassault Industries.</p>
</text>
